        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="side-head" value="HỢP ĐỒNG &amp;amp; RÀNG BUỘC" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=26;fontColor=#17365D;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1620" y="162" width="715" height="42" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="scope" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:22px;color:#245CA6;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.24&quot;&gt;PHẠM VI V4.0&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:20px;color:#20364D;line-height:1.24;margin-top:9px&quot;&gt;49 US · 36 MUST / 1 SHOULD / 12 WON’T&lt;br&gt;FR1–28 · 119 AC · 26 API nền + 16 API mới đề xuất (API-27–42).&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=9;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EAF2FD;strokeColor=#A5C1E6;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;fontColor=#20364D;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1620" y="220" width="715" height="145" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="states" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;color:#17365D;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.24&quot;&gt;5 NHÓM TRẠNG THÁI ĐỘC LẬP&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:20px;color:#20364D;line-height:1.24;margin-top:9px&quot;&gt;users.account_status: ACTIVE / LOCKED&lt;br&gt;employer_profiles.verification_status: PENDING / APPROVED /&lt;br&gt;REJECTED&lt;br&gt;job_posts.moderation_status: PENDING / APPROVED / REJECTED&lt;br&gt;job_posts.status: RECRUITING / FILLED / COMPLETED / EXPIRED /&lt;br&gt;CANCELLED&lt;br&gt;applications.status: PENDING / APPROVED / REJECTED /&lt;br&gt;JOB_EXPIRED / JOB_CANCELLED&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=9;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F6F8FA;strokeColor=#C9D7E4;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;fontColor=#20364D;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1620" y="382" width="715" height="340" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="gate" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;color:#7650A4;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.24&quot;&gt;HAI CỔNG KIỂM DUYỆT&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:20px;color:#20364D;line-height:1.24;margin-top:9px&quot;&gt;NTD ACTIVE + APPROVED mới tạo tin. Tin mới RECRUITING /&lt;br&gt;PENDING. Chỉ tin APPROVED và đủ điều kiện mới công khai,&lt;br&gt;Matching, nhận đơn. Admin không tự đổi vòng đời tin / đơn.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=9;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F7F0FC;strokeColor=#CDBCE2;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;fontColor=#20364D;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1620" y="739" width="715" height="202" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="security" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;color:#237354;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.24&quot;&gt;BẢO MẬT VÀ TRANSACTION&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:20px;color:#20364D;line-height:1.24;margin-top:9px&quot;&gt;BE chặn LOCKED kể cả JWT cũ; Admin không tự xem CV/lịch rảnh&lt;br&gt;SV. Khóa user → profile → category → job → application; worker chỉ&lt;br&gt;job → đơn. Ghi trạng thái + notification cùng transaction.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=9;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0F8F4;strokeColor=#B9D5C6;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;fontColor=#20364D;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1620" y="958" width="715" height="205" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="geo" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;color:#245CA6;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.24&quot;&gt;ĐỊA BÀN, LỊCH &amp;amp; THỜI GIAN&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:20px;color:#20364D;line-height:1.24;margin-top:9px&quot;&gt;Mã tỉnh/phường dạng chuỗi, FK ghép; OR giữa nhóm địa bàn, AND&lt;br&gt;lọc khác. 1–21 ca/tin, ca đêm một logic; Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=9;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EDF4FC;strokeColor=#A5C1E6;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;fontColor=#20364D;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1620" y="1180" width="715" height="172" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="approval" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:23px;color:#94651D;font-weight:bold;line-height:1.24&quot;&gt;CỔNG PHÊ DUYỆT TRƯỚC CODE (*)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:20px;color:#20364D;line-height:1.24;margin-top:9px&quot;&gt;BR43/50: nguồn địa bàn, mã/API/schema, legacy. BR45/51: thuế,&lt;br&gt;minh chứng và lưu/xóa. BR48: lĩnh vực riêng/chung. BR46: duyệt lại&lt;br&gt;tin. BR47: khóa NTD có tin/đơn, token sau mở khóa. Không tự&lt;br&gt;APPROVED dữ liệu cũ.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=9;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF5E5;strokeColor=#D9BD86;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=12;fontColor=#20364D;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1620" y="1369" width="715" height="261" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="side-note" value="Dashboard US49 = SHOULD; 6 số đếm thật, không bảng riêng. (*) Thiết&lt;br&gt;kế kỹ thuật chờ duyệt." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=19;fontColor=#52677C;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1620" y="1640" width="715" height="61" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="foot" value="Căn cứ: SRS v2.0 (phạm vi v4.0) · API Contract / Database Schema / Công nghệ / Sprint Plan v4.0 · Thiết kế mục tiêu, chưa xác minh triển khai." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#52677C;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
